{
    "name": "comic-auto",
    "display_name": "Comic Auto",
    "description": "Comic Auto 是自托管的漫画订阅自动化管理系统，支持多站点探索、订阅追更、自动下载、元数据刮削，并可联动 Komga / Kavita 媒体库自动入库。",
    "category": "comic",
    "tags": [
        "漫画",
        "订阅追更",
        "自动下载",
        "刮削",
        "Komga",
        "Kavita"
    ],
    "website": "https://comic.freeapps.uk/",
    "source_url": null,
    "architectures": [
        "amd64",
        "arm64"
    ],
    "image": "free5104/comic-auto:v2.0.8",
    "default_ports": [
        {
            "port": 8055,
            "protocol": "tcp",
            "description": "Web 界面与 API"
        }
    ],
    "config_schema": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
            "ports",
            "volumes",
            "comic_auto_env"
        ],
        "containers": [
            {
                "name": "comic-auto",
                "title": "Comic Auto",
                "settings": [
                    {
                        "type": "ports",
                        "title": "端口设置",
                        "fields": [
                            "ports"
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "volumes",
                        "title": "存储空间设置",
                        "fields": [
                            "volumes"
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "env",
                        "title": "环境变量",
                        "fields": [
                            "comic_auto_env"
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "advanced",
                        "title": "高级设置",
                        "fields": [
                            "privileged"
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "description": "Comic Auto 漫画订阅与下载服务"
            }
        ],
        "properties": {
            "ports": {
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                    "type": "object",
                    "required": [
                        "local_port",
                        "container_port",
                        "protocol"
                    ],
                    "properties": {
                        "protocol": {
                            "enum": [
                                "tcp",
                                "udp"
                            ],
                            "type": "string",
                            "title": "协议",
                            "default": "tcp"
                        },
                        "local_port": {
                            "type": "integer",
                            "title": "本地端口",
                            "maximum": 65535,
                            "minimum": 1
                        },
                        "container_port": {
                            "type": "integer",
                            "title": "容器端口",
                            "maximum": 65535,
                            "minimum": 1
                        }
                    }
                },
                "title": "端口设置",
                "default": [
                    {
                        "protocol": "tcp",
                        "local_port": 8055,
                        "container_port": 80
                    }
                ]
            },
            "volumes": {
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                    "type": "object",
                    "required": [
                        "host_path",
                        "container_path",
                        "mode"
                    ],
                    "properties": {
                        "mode": {
                            "enum": [
                                "rw",
                                "ro"
                            ],
                            "type": "string",
                            "title": "权限",
                            "default": "rw"
                        },
                        "host_path": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "title": "本地路径",
                            "format": "directory"
                        },
                        "container_path": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "title": "容器路径"
                        }
                    }
                },
                "title": "存储空间设置",
                "description": "Comic Auto 使用内置 PostgreSQL 保存数据；漫画目录由编排共享存储统一挂载",
                "default": [
                    {
                        "mode": "rw",
                        "host_path": "comic-auto/pgdata",
                        "container_path": "/var/lib/postgresql/16/main"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "privileged": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "title": "特权模式",
                "default": false,
                "description": "一般情况下无需开启，仅当应用需要访问宿主机硬件设备时启用"
            },
            "comic_auto_env": {
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                    "type": "object",
                    "required": [
                        "key",
                        "value"
                    ],
                    "properties": {
                        "key": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "title": "变量名"
                        },
                        "value": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "title": "值"
                        }
                    }
                },
                "title": "环境变量",
                "default": [
                    {
                        "key": "TZ",
                        "value": "Asia/Shanghai"
                    }
                ]
            }
        }
    },
    "yaml_template": "services:\n  comic-auto:\n    image: {{ image }}\n    container_name: {{ project_name }}\n    ports:\n{%- for port in ports %}\n      - \"{{ port.local_port }}:{{ port.container_port }}/{{ port.protocol }}\"\n{%- endfor %}\n    volumes:\n{%- for vol in volumes %}\n      - {{ to_host_path(vol.host_path if (vol.host_path.startswith('/') or vol.shared) else project_name ~ '/' ~ vol.host_path) }}:{{ vol.container_path }}:{{ vol.mode }}\n{%- endfor %}\n    privileged: {{ privileged | lower }}\n    restart: unless-stopped\n    environment:\n{%- for item in comic_auto_env %}\n      - {{ item.key }}={{ item.value }}\n{%- endfor %}\n",
    "readme": "# Comic Auto\n\nComic Auto 是漫画订阅自动化管理系统：聚合多平台榜单探索新漫画，订阅后自动检查更新、下载新章节，并联动 Komga / Kavita 自动完成入库与元数据刮削。\n\n## 部署前准备\n\n1. 默认端口 `8055`（容器内 `80`），如有冲突请修改本地端口。\n2. 「存储空间设置」中的 `/var/lib/postgresql/16/main` 是应用内置 PostgreSQL 的数据目录，**请勿删除**。\n3. 漫画目录请通过「漫画自动化」编排的共享存储挂载到 `/mnt/media`，并先在共享目录下创建 `cache`、`down` 两个子目录；随后在 Comic Auto 系统设置中配置：\n   - 缓存目录：`/mnt/media/cache`\n   - 下载目录：`/mnt/media/down`\n4. 首次部署完成后访问 `http://<NAS-IP>:8055` 创建管理员账号；订阅追更、云端数据等功能需要按官方说明激活授权。\n\n## 与媒体库联动\n\nComic Auto 负责下载，Komga / Kavita 负责阅读展示。部署「漫画自动化」组合后，NasDeck 会自动创建媒体库账号并完成阅读器装配；下载目录与媒体库目录指向同一共享目录，新章节下载后会自动通知媒体库扫描入库。\n\n官方文档：https://comic.freeapps.uk/guide/",
    "version": "2.0.8",
    "type": "compose",
    "changelog": "初始导入",
    "backup_paths": [
        "/var/lib/postgresql/16/main"
    ],
    "is_builtin": false
}
